        "value": "藩制一覽表第九（峯岡、三草）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "藩制一覧表第九（峰岡、三草）／はんせいいちらんひょう だいきゅう"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Running header: Hansei ichiran-hyō, Fascicle 9 (Mineoka, Mikusa). Fascicle 9 is the officials-and-military fascicle of the 1869-70 Dajōkan domain survey. The header is provenance, not data, and it names only the two domains whose maru-markers open on this leaf; the block of councillors and troops filling the right-hand third of the page belongs to a domain whose marker stood on the preceding leaf."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "版心藩制一覽表第九（峯岡藩・三草藩分）"
      }
