        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "權大參事　一人　三人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "権大参事　一人〔右傍に小字で「三人」〕／ごんだいさんじ"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Acting senior councillor (gon-dai-sanji). The full-size type prints 一人 (1 person); a small-type 三人 (3 persons) stands in the gutter immediately to its right, with no parentheses around it. Three men are in fact named under this office — Masaki Fuken and Okazaki Goshū in this column's two name registers, and Shinjō Seie in the label-less column next to the left — so 三人 is the 1928 editor's corrected figure and 一人 is the original's error. Recorded as 3."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "宮川權大參事"
      }
